-- M9 上線前唯讀檢查 00d：00c 查不出的那些舊版 migration（只改函式內容、授權、約束、資料），正式區到底有沒有套用？
-- 為什麼要跑：00c 只能確認「物件存在」。有 32 支舊版 migration 沒有新建任何物件，只是改寫函式本文、收回或補上授權、換約束內容、補權限授與或資料，
--   物件早就存在，所以 00c 看不出它們有沒有跑過（結果的 unchecked_migrations 就是這幾支）。這份對每一支挑 1～3 個「套用後才會成立」的記號，
--   直接比對正式區現況（函式內容含不含某段字串、誰有 EXECUTE 權、約束定義、欄位型別、註解、權限授與、種子資料）。標記清單是人工逐支讀過 migration 內容挑的。
--
-- 怎麼用（老闆照做即可）：
--   1. 打開正式區 Supabase 的 SQL Editor，新開一個查詢。
--   2. 把這個檔案整份貼上，按 Run。
--   3. 結果只有一列一格（欄位名 result，內容是一段 JSON）。點開那一格，整段複製，貼回給我。
--   4. 這份只有查詢，不會建立、修改、刪除任何東西，可以隨時重複執行。
--
-- 怎麼看結果：
--   generated_at     執行時間
--   total_checked    總共檢查幾個標記
--   present_count    正式區成立的標記數
--   missing          不成立的標記清單；每筆有 migration（哪一支舊版 migration）、marker（查什麼）、meaning（成立代表什麼）、
--                    superseded_by（有寫的話，代表後面哪個步驟會蓋掉它：那一項缺了無妨，或重跑時變「缺」是預期的；null 代表沒有被取代，缺了就是真的沒套用）
--   undeterminable   「無法以唯讀查詢判斷」的 migration（純資料修補、跑完不留痕跡），每筆說明風險與後續是否被 m9 步驟取代
--   observations     給無法判斷的資料修補用的輔助數字：還會被那支 migration 改動幾筆（0 = 已修或本來就不需要）；null = 該表或欄位不存在
--   missing 是空的 []，代表這 31 支舊版 migration 的記號正式區都成立。
--   missing 裡 superseded_by 不是 null 的項目，多半不用處理；superseded_by 是 null 的項目才要逐一回報給 Claude，由 Claude 判斷是補套用該支 migration 還是已有替代做法。
--
-- 判斷規則：
--   以「舊版 migration 全部套用後的最終狀態」為準：後面還有別支舊版覆蓋的函式，只挑最後一版仍保留的字串。
--   記號只看唯讀目錄（pg_get_functiondef、pg_get_constraintdef、has_function_privilege、pg_policies、permissions 與 role_permissions 等），不會執行任何寫入。
--   資料庫裡不存在的函式、表、約束一律當作「不成立」，不會讓整份查詢報錯。
--   正式區有人手動改過（例如老闆用權限勾選頁改了授權）時，授權類記號會缺，標在 superseded_by 的說明裡。
--
-- 檢查範圍（共 61 個標記，來自 31 支舊版 migration，其中 13 個標有 superseded_by；另有 1 支列為無法判斷）。
-- 本檔由 scripts/m9-coverage/markers.cjs 依 scripts/m9-coverage/markers.data.cjs 自動產生，請勿手改；標記或 README 步驟有變動時重跑：node scripts/m9-coverage/markers.cjs
-- 只用 SELECT／WITH 與 to_regprocedure、to_regclass、pg_get_functiondef、pg_get_constraintdef、has_function_privilege、pg_catalog、pg_policies、pg_indexes、public.permissions／roles／role_permissions 查詢。
WITH items(migration, marker, meaning, superseded_by, ok) AS (VALUES
  ('20260722055852_fix_inventory_location_cascade_deletion_reason', '函式內容不含「父庫存位置刪除衍生」：public.ga_soft_delete_inventory_location(uuid,text)', '刪除庫存位置時，連帶刪除的下層明細，原因與上層相同（修正前的版本會在原因前面多加「父庫存位置刪除衍生：」）。成立代表已是修正後的版本。', NULL, COALESCE(position('父庫存位置刪除衍生' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_soft_delete_inventory_location(uuid,text)'))) = 0, false)),
  ('20260722091526_revoke_inventory_transaction_sequence_grants', '序列 USAGE 授權（authenticated=不可、anon=不可）：public.ga_inventory_transaction_no_seq', '庫存交易編號的序列，已收回登入使用者與匿名的使用權（只能由資料庫函式取號）。成立代表這支已套用。', NULL, COALESCE(has_sequence_privilege('authenticated', to_regclass('public.ga_inventory_transaction_no_seq'), 'USAGE') = false, false) AND COALESCE(has_sequence_privilege('anon', to_regclass('public.ga_inventory_transaction_no_seq'), 'USAGE') = false, false)),
  ('20260722092849_restrict_inventory_transaction_function_execute_grants', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=不可、anon=不可）：public.ga_next_inventory_transaction_no()', '取庫存交易編號的函式，登入使用者與匿名都不能直接執行。成立代表已收回授權。', NULL, COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.ga_next_inventory_transaction_no()'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.ga_next_inventory_transaction_no()'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260722092849_restrict_inventory_transaction_function_execute_grants', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可、anon=不可）：public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)', '庫存過帳函式只開放給登入使用者、不開放匿名。成立代表授權已整理成預期狀態。', NULL, COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260722094917_fix_inventory_balance_upsert_conflict_ambiguity', '函式內容含「ON CONFLICT ON CONSTRAINT ga_inventory_balan…」：public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)', '庫存過帳函式改用「指定約束名稱」的 ON CONFLICT 寫法，避免欄位名稱不明確的錯誤。成立代表已套用。', NULL, COALESCE(position('ON CONFLICT ON CONSTRAINT ga_inventory_balances_location_part_unique DO NOTHING;' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260722094917_fix_inventory_balance_upsert_conflict_ambiguity', '函式內容不含「ON CONFLICT (location_id, part_id) DO NOTHIN…」：public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)', '舊的有歧義寫法 ON CONFLICT (location_id, part_id) 已不在函式裡。成立代表已替換。', NULL, COALESCE(position('ON CONFLICT (location_id, part_id) DO NOTHING;' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_post_inventory_transaction(text,uuid,uuid,numeric,text,text,text,text,uuid,text,timestamptz,jsonb)'))) = 0, false)),
  ('20260727021000_general_affairs_maintenance_work_order_permission_split', '權限碼都存在且啟用（8 個）：general_affairs.maintenance_request.create 等', '總務維修回報與工單的 8 個權限碼都存在且啟用。成立代表維修／工單權限已從跨部門維修拆出。', NULL, (SELECT count(DISTINCT pm.code) FROM public.permissions pm WHERE pm.code = ANY (ARRAY['general_affairs.maintenance_request.create', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_all', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.update', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_all', 'general_affairs.work_order.update', 'general_affairs.work_order.manage']) AND pm.is_active) = 8),
  ('20260727021000_general_affairs_maintenance_work_order_permission_split', 'RLS 政策含「general_affairs.work_order.manage」（qual）：p1e_maintenance_requests_read on maintenance_requests', '維修回報的讀取政策認得總務工單管理權限。成立代表政策已改成同時接受總務與跨部門兩組權限。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('general_affairs.work_order.manage' IN COALESCE(pp.qual, '')) > 0 FROM pg_policies pp WHERE pp.schemaname = 'public' AND pp.tablename = 'maintenance_requests' AND pp.policyname = 'p1e_maintenance_requests_read'), false)),
  ('20260730010048_grant_resource_attachment_visibility_helpers', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可、anon=不可）：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)', '附件「能不能讀」的判斷函式已開放給登入使用者、沒開給匿名；沒開的話附件清單會報 permission denied for function。', NULL, COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260730010048_grant_resource_attachment_visibility_helpers', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可、anon=不可）：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)', '附件「能不能管理」的判斷函式已開放給登入使用者、沒開給匿名；沒開的話上傳附件會報 permission denied。', NULL, COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260810090000_allow_part_resource_attachments', '約束定義含「''PART''」：ga_resource_attachments_resource_type_check on public.ga_resource_attachments', '附件的資源類型白名單含 PART（料件）。後面別支舊版與 m7m8 步驟都保留 PART，所以最終狀態也成立。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('''PART''' IN pg_get_constraintdef(c.oid)) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_resource_attachments') AND c.conname = 'ga_resource_attachments_resource_type_check'), false)),
  ('20260810090000_allow_part_resource_attachments', '函式內容含「FROM public.ga_parts p」：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)', '附件讀取判斷函式有料件（PART）分支。後面別支舊版與 m7m8 步驟都保留這個分支。', NULL, COALESCE(position('FROM public.ga_parts p' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260812153524_grant_supervisor_management_rls_helper_execute', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可、anon=不可）：public.supervisor_management_case_is_visible(uuid)', '督導日誌案件可見性函式（RLS 政策會呼叫）已開放給登入使用者、沒開給匿名。', '步驟 38（m9-sql/07_legacy_supervisor_management.sql）：會建立督導管理日誌的最終版（含這項），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_case_is_visible(uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_case_is_visible(uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260812153524_grant_supervisor_management_rls_helper_execute', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可、anon=不可）：public.supervisor_management_case_is_manageable(uuid)', '督導日誌案件可管理函式已開放給登入使用者、沒開給匿名。', '步驟 38（m9-sql/07_legacy_supervisor_management.sql）：會建立督導管理日誌的最終版（含這項），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_case_is_manageable(uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_case_is_manageable(uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260812153524_grant_supervisor_management_rls_helper_execute', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可、anon=不可）：public.supervisor_management_current_user_manages_store(uuid)', '督導日誌「目前使用者是否管理該門市」函式已開放給登入使用者、沒開給匿名。', '步驟 38（m9-sql/07_legacy_supervisor_management.sql）：會建立督導管理日誌的最終版（含這項），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_current_user_manages_store(uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_current_user_manages_store(uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260812155612_fix_supervisor_management_case_insert_visibility', '函式內容含「SUPERVISOR_CASE_OWNER_MISMATCH」：public.supervisor_management_validate_case()', '督導日誌案件驗證觸發函式，建立案件時要求負責人必須是目前登入者（除非有管理權限）。', '步驟 38（m9-sql/07_legacy_supervisor_management.sql）：會建立督導管理日誌的最終版（含這項），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE(position('SUPERVISOR_CASE_OWNER_MISMATCH' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_validate_case()'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260812155612_fix_supervisor_management_case_insert_visibility', 'RLS 政策含「owner_user_id = auth.uid()」（with_check）：supervisor_management_cases_insert on supervisor_management_cases', '督導日誌案件的新增政策，有建立權限者只能新增負責人是自己的案件。', '步驟 38（m9-sql/07_legacy_supervisor_management.sql）：會建立督導管理日誌的最終版（含這項），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE((SELECT position('owner_user_id = auth.uid()' IN COALESCE(pp.with_check, '')) > 0 FROM pg_policies pp WHERE pp.schemaname = 'public' AND pp.tablename = 'supervisor_management_cases' AND pp.policyname = 'supervisor_management_cases_insert'), false)),
  ('20260812155612_fix_supervisor_management_case_insert_visibility', '函式內容含「supervisor.management_log.create」：public.supervisor_management_case_is_visible(uuid)', '案件可見性函式讓「只有建立權限」的人也看得到自己的案件（否則新增後讀回會被擋）。', '步驟 38（m9-sql/07_legacy_supervisor_management.sql）：會建立督導管理日誌的最終版（含這項），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE(position('supervisor.management_log.create' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.supervisor_management_case_is_visible(uuid)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260820093000_grant_organization_permissions_to_admin_roles', '角色 admin 對 8 個權限碼都有授權：organization.organization.view 等', '組織管理的 8 個權限碼存在，且系統管理員（admin 角色）都有授權。成立代表組織管理選單對管理員已開。', '授權之後由權限勾選頁（授權步驟）決定；老闆改過授權就會缺，不一定代表舊版沒套用', (SELECT count(DISTINCT pm.code) FROM public.roles r JOIN public.role_permissions rp ON rp.role_id = r.id JOIN public.permissions pm ON pm.id = rp.permission_id WHERE r.code = 'admin' AND rp.is_allowed AND pm.is_active AND pm.code = ANY (ARRAY['organization.organization.view', 'organization.department.view', 'organization.department.create', 'organization.department.edit', 'organization.member.view', 'organization.member.manage', 'organization.manager.view', 'organization.manager.manage'])) = 8),
  ('20260826004500_general_affairs_service_request_comment_attachments', '約束定義含「''SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT''」：ga_resource_attachments_resource_type_check on public.ga_resource_attachments', '附件資源類型白名單含需求單留言（SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT）。後面的版本都保留。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('''SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT''' IN pg_get_constraintdef(c.oid)) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_resource_attachments') AND c.conname = 'ga_resource_attachments_resource_type_check'), false)),
  ('20260826004500_general_affairs_service_request_comment_attachments', '函式內容含「p_resource_type = ''SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT''」：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)', '附件讀取判斷函式有需求單留言分支。後面的版本都保留。', NULL, COALESCE(position('p_resource_type = ''SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT''' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_read(text,uuid)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260826004500_general_affairs_service_request_comment_attachments', '函式內容含「p_resource_type = ''SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT''」：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)', '附件管理判斷函式有需求單留言分支。後面的版本都保留。', NULL, COALESCE(position('p_resource_type = ''SERVICE_REQUEST_COMMENT''' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260826023000_employee_movement_store_employee_rls_alignment', '函式內容含「public.has_permission(auth.uid(), p_permissi…」：public.current_user_has_permission(character varying)', 'current_user_has_permission 是包裝 has_permission 的版本（RLS 政策共用）。成立代表函式是這支 migration 的版本。', NULL, COALESCE(position('public.has_permission(auth.uid(), p_permission_code)' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.current_user_has_permission(character varying)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260826023000_employee_movement_store_employee_rls_alignment', 'RLS 政策含「employee.promotion.batch」（with_check）：p1c_store_employees_insert_manage on store_employees', '新增員工的 RLS 政策認得「批次升遷」權限，正式入職流程才寫得進 store_employees。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('employee.promotion.batch' IN COALESCE(pp.with_check, '')) > 0 FROM pg_policies pp WHERE pp.schemaname = 'public' AND pp.tablename = 'store_employees' AND pp.policyname = 'p1c_store_employees_insert_manage'), false)),
  ('20260826023000_employee_movement_store_employee_rls_alignment', 'RLS 政策含「employee.promotion.batch」（qual）：p1c_employee_movement_manage on employee_movement_history', '異動紀錄的管理政策認得「批次升遷」權限。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('employee.promotion.batch' IN COALESCE(pp.qual, '')) > 0 FROM pg_policies pp WHERE pp.schemaname = 'public' AND pp.tablename = 'employee_movement_history' AND pp.policyname = 'p1c_employee_movement_manage'), false)),
  ('20260826042500_general_affairs_store_onboarding_attachment_scope', '函式內容含「e.onboarding_status IN (''NEEDS_EQUIPMENT_PHO…」：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)', '店長可替自己門市、還在「待拍照」階段的設備上傳附件。後面的版本都保留這個分支。', NULL, COALESCE(position('e.onboarding_status IN (''NEEDS_EQUIPMENT_PHOTO'', ''NEEDS_LABEL_PHOTO'')' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260826042500_general_affairs_store_onboarding_attachment_scope', '函式內容含「OR sr.created_by = auth.uid()」：public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)', '需求單附件：建立人本人可管理自己的需求單附件。後面的版本都保留。', NULL, COALESCE(position('OR sr.created_by = auth.uid()' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_resource_attachment_can_manage(text,uuid)'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260827103000_general_affairs_service_request_optional_repair_target', '約束存在：ga_service_requests_repair_optional_resource_check on public.ga_service_requests', '維修需求單「可不綁設備／設施」的約束存在（最終內容由 20260827124500 更新，名稱不變）。', NULL, EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_service_requests') AND c.conname = 'ga_service_requests_repair_optional_resource_check')),
  ('20260827103000_general_affairs_service_request_optional_repair_target', '約束已不存在：ga_service_requests_repair_bound_resource_check on public.ga_service_requests', '舊的「維修一定要綁設備或設施」約束已移除。成立代表維修回報可以先不綁標的。', NULL, (to_regclass('public.ga_service_requests') IS NOT NULL AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_service_requests') AND c.conname = 'ga_service_requests_repair_bound_resource_check'))),
  ('20260827124500_general_affairs_service_request_typed_unbound_repair_target', '約束註解含「若知道大類可先標示設備或設施」：ga_service_requests_repair_optional_resource_check on public.ga_service_requests', '維修需求單約束是最新版（可先標示設備或設施大類、尚未綁主檔）。用約束註解判斷，註解是這支 migration 寫的。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('若知道大類可先標示設備或設施' IN obj_description(c.oid, 'pg_constraint')) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_service_requests') AND c.conname = 'ga_service_requests_repair_optional_resource_check'), false)),
  ('20260827131500_seed_maintenance_progress_stages', '種子資料 16 筆都存在且啟用：maintenance_progress_stages', '維修進度的 16 個階段代碼都存在且啟用。成立代表種子資料已寫入（沒有的話進度下拉選單會是空的）。', NULL, COALESCE((CASE WHEN to_regclass('public.maintenance_progress_stages') IS NOT NULL THEN ((xpath('/row/c/text()', query_to_xml('SELECT count(*) AS c FROM public.maintenance_progress_stages WHERE code = ANY (ARRAY[''INITIAL_REVIEW'', ''WAITING_STORE_INFO'', ''INTERNAL_HANDLING'', ''SEARCHING_VENDOR'', ''WAITING_VENDOR_REPLY'', ''WAITING_VENDOR_QUOTE'', ''QUOTE_REVIEW'', ''VENDOR_ASSIGNED'', ''WAITING_VENDOR_VISIT'', ''VENDOR_WORKING'', ''WAITING_PARTS'', ''PARTS_IN_TRANSIT'', ''WAITING_INTERNAL_APPROVAL'', ''WAITING_STORE_CONFIRMATION'', ''REOPENED'', ''OTHER'']) AND is_active', false, true, '')))[1]::text::bigint) = 16 END), false)),
  ('20260914095000_employee_purchase_employee_summary_rpc', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（authenticated=可）：public.employee_purchase_employee_summary(text,text)', '員工購買彙總函式存在，且登入使用者可執行。這支 migration 是補丁（補建這個函式與授權）。', NULL, COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.employee_purchase_employee_summary(text,text)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false)),
  ('20260918153000_restrict_part_fulfillment_permissions', 'RLS 政策不含「general_affairs.request.manage」（any）：ga_part_fulfillments_read on ga_part_fulfillments', '料件處理單的讀取政策已收窄成只認「料件處理」權限（不再讓需求單管理者讀取）。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('general_affairs.request.manage' IN COALESCE(pp.qual, '') || ' ' || COALESCE(pp.with_check, '')) = 0 FROM pg_policies pp WHERE pp.schemaname = 'public' AND pp.tablename = 'ga_part_fulfillments' AND pp.policyname = 'ga_part_fulfillments_read'), false)),
  ('20260918153000_restrict_part_fulfillment_permissions', 'RLS 政策不含「general_affairs.request.manage」（any）：ga_part_fulfillments_manage on ga_part_fulfillments', '料件處理單的管理政策已收窄成只認「料件處理管理」權限。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('general_affairs.request.manage' IN COALESCE(pp.qual, '') || ' ' || COALESCE(pp.with_check, '')) = 0 FROM pg_policies pp WHERE pp.schemaname = 'public' AND pp.tablename = 'ga_part_fulfillments' AND pp.policyname = 'ga_part_fulfillments_manage'), false)),
  ('20260920113000_general_affairs_equipment_template_compatibilities', '約束定義含「EQUIPMENT_TEMPLATE」：ga_part_target_compatibilities_target_type_check on public.ga_part_target_compatibilities', '料件相容對象類型含「設備型號」（EQUIPMENT_TEMPLATE）。成立代表設備型號可以設相容料件。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('EQUIPMENT_TEMPLATE' IN pg_get_constraintdef(c.oid)) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_part_target_compatibilities') AND c.conname = 'ga_part_target_compatibilities_target_type_check'), false)),
  ('20260920113000_general_affairs_equipment_template_compatibilities', '函式內容含「ga_equipment_templates」：public.ga_validate_part_target_compatibility()', '相容性驗證函式會檢查設備型號是否存在、啟用。', NULL, COALESCE(position('ga_equipment_templates' IN pg_get_functiondef(to_regprocedure('public.ga_validate_part_target_compatibility()'))) > 0, false)),
  ('20260925110000_general_affairs_utility_bill_electricity_usage', '欄位型別是 numeric(12,2)：public.ga_utility_bills.electricity_kwh', '水電帳單有用電度數欄位（numeric(12,2)）。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT format_type(a.atttypid, a.atttypmod) = 'numeric(12,2)' FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_utility_bills') AND a.attname = 'electricity_kwh' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped), false)),
  ('20260925110000_general_affairs_utility_bill_electricity_usage', '約束存在：ga_utility_bills_electricity_kwh_check on public.ga_utility_bills', '用電度數只能出現在電費帳單、且不能是負數的約束存在。', NULL, EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_utility_bills') AND c.conname = 'ga_utility_bills_electricity_kwh_check')),
  ('20260926090000_general_affairs_utility_bill_identifiers', '欄位存在：public.ga_utility_bills.service_identifier 且 欄位存在：public.ga_utility_bills.equipment_serial', '水電帳單有「服務識別碼」與「設備序號」兩欄。', NULL, (EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_utility_bills') AND a.attname = 'service_identifier' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped) AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_utility_bills') AND a.attname = 'equipment_serial' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped))),
  ('20260926090000_general_affairs_utility_bill_identifiers', '索引定義含「service_identifier」：uq_ga_utility_bills_identity', '水電帳單防重複的唯一索引已納入服務識別碼（同月可有多條線路）。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('service_identifier' IN ix.indexdef) > 0 FROM pg_indexes ix WHERE ix.schemaname = 'public' AND ix.indexname = 'uq_ga_utility_bills_identity'), false)),
  ('20260926093000_general_affairs_internet_multiple_lines', '欄位存在：public.ga_utility_bills.service_label', '水電帳單有「服務名稱／線路標示」欄位（網路多線路用）。', NULL, EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_utility_bills') AND a.attname = 'service_label' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped)),
  ('20260926100000_general_affairs_utility_bill_attachments', '約束定義含「''UTILITY_BILL''」：ga_resource_attachments_resource_type_check on public.ga_resource_attachments', '附件資源類型白名單含水電帳單（UTILITY_BILL）。後面的 m7m8 步驟只會再加類型，不會拿掉。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('''UTILITY_BILL''' IN pg_get_constraintdef(c.oid)) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_resource_attachments') AND c.conname = 'ga_resource_attachments_resource_type_check'), false)),
  ('20260926153000_general_affairs_production_role_matrix', '角色 admin 對 15 個權限碼都有授權：general_affairs.maintenance_request.create 等', '系統管理員（admin）對這 15 個總務權限碼都有授權（維修回報、工單、廠商、服務分類／區域、合作紀錄）。', '授權之後由權限勾選頁（授權步驟）決定；老闆改過授權就會缺，不一定代表舊版沒套用', (SELECT count(DISTINCT pm.code) FROM public.roles r JOIN public.role_permissions rp ON rp.role_id = r.id JOIN public.permissions pm ON pm.id = rp.permission_id WHERE r.code = 'admin' AND rp.is_allowed AND pm.is_active AND pm.code = ANY (ARRAY['general_affairs.maintenance_request.create', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_all', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.update', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_all', 'general_affairs.work_order.update', 'general_affairs.work_order.manage', 'general_affairs.vendor.view', 'general_affairs.vendor.manage', 'general_affairs.service_category.view', 'general_affairs.service_category.manage', 'general_affairs.service_region.view', 'general_affairs.service_region.manage', 'general_affairs.cooperation_record.view'])) = 15),
  ('20260926153000_general_affairs_production_role_matrix', '角色 general_affairs 對 15 個權限碼都有授權：general_affairs.maintenance_request.create 等', '總務角色（general_affairs）對這 15 個總務權限碼都有授權。', '授權之後由權限勾選頁（授權步驟）決定；老闆改過授權就會缺，不一定代表舊版沒套用', (SELECT count(DISTINCT pm.code) FROM public.roles r JOIN public.role_permissions rp ON rp.role_id = r.id JOIN public.permissions pm ON pm.id = rp.permission_id WHERE r.code = 'general_affairs' AND rp.is_allowed AND pm.is_active AND pm.code = ANY (ARRAY['general_affairs.maintenance_request.create', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_all', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.update', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_all', 'general_affairs.work_order.update', 'general_affairs.work_order.manage', 'general_affairs.vendor.view', 'general_affairs.vendor.manage', 'general_affairs.service_category.view', 'general_affairs.service_category.manage', 'general_affairs.service_region.view', 'general_affairs.service_region.manage', 'general_affairs.cooperation_record.view'])) = 15),
  ('20260926153000_general_affairs_production_role_matrix', '角色 store_manager_role 對 8 個權限碼都有授權：general_affairs.service_center.access 等', '店長角色（store_manager_role）有 8 個自己門市的總務權限（進服務中心、建立／查看／留言／確認需求單與維修回報）。', '授權之後由權限勾選頁（授權步驟）決定；老闆改過授權就會缺，不一定代表舊版沒套用', (SELECT count(DISTINCT pm.code) FROM public.roles r JOIN public.role_permissions rp ON rp.role_id = r.id JOIN public.permissions pm ON pm.id = rp.permission_id WHERE r.code = 'store_manager_role' AND rp.is_allowed AND pm.is_active AND pm.code = ANY (ARRAY['general_affairs.service_center.access', 'general_affairs.request.create', 'general_affairs.request.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.request.comment_own_store', 'general_affairs.request.confirm_own_store', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.create', 'general_affairs.maintenance_request.view_own_store', 'general_affairs.work_order.view_own_store'])) = 8),
  ('20260926160000_atomic_role_permission_updates', '函式 EXECUTE 授權（service_role=可、authenticated=不可、anon=不可）：public.replace_role_permissions(uuid,uuid[],uuid[],uuid)', '角色權限整組替換函式（4 參數版）只有 service_role 能執行，登入使用者與匿名都不行。', '舊版 20260926163000 已把 3 參數版 DROP 後改成 4 參數版；這支的最終效果就是這兩項，其中一項缺代表 20260926163000 或本支沒套用（00c 會顯示 163000 的函式在不在）', COALESCE(has_function_privilege('service_role', to_regprocedure('public.replace_role_permissions(uuid,uuid[],uuid[],uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = true, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('authenticated', to_regprocedure('public.replace_role_permissions(uuid,uuid[],uuid[],uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false) AND COALESCE(has_function_privilege('anon', to_regprocedure('public.replace_role_permissions(uuid,uuid[],uuid[],uuid)'), 'EXECUTE') = false, false)),
  ('20260926160000_atomic_role_permission_updates', '函式已不存在：public.replace_role_permissions(uuid,uuid[],uuid)', '舊的 3 參數版已不存在（被 4 參數版取代）。', '舊版 20260926163000 已把 3 參數版 DROP 後改成 4 參數版；這支的最終效果就是這兩項，其中一項缺代表 20260926163000 或本支沒套用（00c 會顯示 163000 的函式在不在）', to_regprocedure('public.replace_role_permissions(uuid,uuid[],uuid)') IS NULL),
  ('20260928110000_repair_equipment_onboarding_schema', '欄位預設值含「NEEDS_EQUIPMENT_PHOTO」：public.ga_equipment.onboarding_status', '設備有 onboarding_status 欄位，預設「待拍設備照」。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('NEEDS_EQUIPMENT_PHOTO' IN pg_get_expr(d.adbin, d.adrelid)) > 0 FROM pg_attrdef d JOIN pg_attribute a ON a.attrelid = d.adrelid AND a.attnum = d.adnum WHERE d.adrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND a.attname = 'onboarding_status'), false)),
  ('20260928110000_repair_equipment_onboarding_schema', '約束定義含「PENDING_GA_REVIEW」：ga_equipment_onboarding_status_check on public.ga_equipment', '設備上線進度的 4 種狀態約束存在（含待總務審核）。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('PENDING_GA_REVIEW' IN pg_get_constraintdef(c.oid)) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND c.conname = 'ga_equipment_onboarding_status_check'), false)),
  ('20260928110000_repair_equipment_onboarding_schema', '觸發器存在：trg_ga_resource_attachments_equipment_onboarding_sync on public.ga_resource_attachments 且 函式存在：public.ga_calculate_equipment_onboarding_status(uuid)', '設備附件變動時自動同步上線進度的觸發器，與計算上線進度的函式都存在。（這支 migration 另有一次性重算進度的 UPDATE，無法單獨判斷，但同一組結構齊了就視為已套用。）', NULL, (EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_trigger g WHERE g.tgrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_resource_attachments') AND g.tgname = 'trg_ga_resource_attachments_equipment_onboarding_sync' AND NOT g.tgisinternal) AND to_regprocedure('public.ga_calculate_equipment_onboarding_status(uuid)') IS NOT NULL)),
  ('20260929090000_repair_general_affairs_asset_qr_schema', '欄位存在：public.ga_equipment.qr_token_revoked_at 且 欄位存在：public.ga_facilities.qr_token_revoked_at 且 欄位存在：public.ga_equipment.qr_token_issued_at 且 欄位存在：public.ga_facilities.qr_token_issued_at', '設備與設施都有 QR 代碼的發行與作廢時間欄位。步驟 43（QR 作廢觸發器）的前置檢查要這幾欄，缺了它會停下來。', NULL, (EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND a.attname = 'qr_token_revoked_at' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped) AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_facilities') AND a.attname = 'qr_token_revoked_at' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped) AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND a.attname = 'qr_token_issued_at' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped) AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_facilities') AND a.attname = 'qr_token_issued_at' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped))),
  ('20260929090000_repair_general_affairs_asset_qr_schema', '約束存在：ga_equipment_qr_token_format on public.ga_equipment 且 約束存在：ga_facilities_qr_token_format on public.ga_facilities 且 索引存在：uq_ga_equipment_qr_token 且 索引存在：uq_ga_facilities_qr_token', 'QR 代碼的格式約束與唯一索引都在（設備、設施各一組）。', NULL, (EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND c.conname = 'ga_equipment_qr_token_format') AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_facilities') AND c.conname = 'ga_facilities_qr_token_format') AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_indexes ix WHERE ix.schemaname = 'public' AND ix.indexname = 'uq_ga_equipment_qr_token') AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_indexes ix WHERE ix.schemaname = 'public' AND ix.indexname = 'uq_ga_facilities_qr_token'))),
  ('20260929090000_repair_general_affairs_asset_qr_schema', '欄位預設值含「gen_random_uuid」：public.ga_equipment.qr_token 且 欄位預設值含「gen_random_uuid」：public.ga_facilities.qr_token 且 沒有空值：ga_equipment.qr_token 且 沒有空值：ga_facilities.qr_token', 'QR 代碼有自動產生的預設值，且沒有任何設備或設施的 QR 代碼是空的（這支 migration 會替空的補上）。', NULL, (COALESCE((SELECT position('gen_random_uuid' IN pg_get_expr(d.adbin, d.adrelid)) > 0 FROM pg_attrdef d JOIN pg_attribute a ON a.attrelid = d.adrelid AND a.attnum = d.adnum WHERE d.adrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND a.attname = 'qr_token'), false) AND COALESCE((SELECT position('gen_random_uuid' IN pg_get_expr(d.adbin, d.adrelid)) > 0 FROM pg_attrdef d JOIN pg_attribute a ON a.attrelid = d.adrelid AND a.attnum = d.adnum WHERE d.adrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_facilities') AND a.attname = 'qr_token'), false) AND COALESCE((CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_equipment') AND a.attname = 'qr_token' AND NOT a.attisdropped) THEN ((xpath('/row/c/text()', query_to_xml('SELECT count(*) AS c FROM public.ga_equipment WHERE qr_token IS NULL', false, true, '')))[1]::text::bigint) = 0 END), false) AND COALESCE((CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.ga_facilities') AND a.attname = 'qr_token' AND NOT a.attisdropped) THEN ((xpath('/row/c/text()', query_to_xml('SELECT count(*) AS c FROM public.ga_facilities WHERE qr_token IS NULL', false, true, '')))[1]::text::bigint) = 0 END), false))),
  ('20261004100000_performance_business_days_half_day', '欄位型別是 numeric(4,1)：public.store_performance.business_days', '門市業績的營業天數欄位可放 0.5 天（numeric(4,1)，原本是整數）。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT format_type(a.atttypid, a.atttypmod) = 'numeric(4,1)' FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.store_performance') AND a.attname = 'business_days' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped), false)),
  ('20261004100000_performance_business_days_half_day', '欄位註解含「支援以 0.5 天為單位」：public.store_performance.business_days', '營業天數欄位註解是這支 migration 寫的（補強上一項的判斷）。只缺這項、上一項成立，代表欄位型別是用別的方式改的，沒有影響使用。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('支援以 0.5 天為單位' IN col_description(a.attrelid, a.attnum)) > 0 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.store_performance') AND a.attname = 'business_days' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped), false)),
  ('20261004110000_monthly_store_summary_business_days_half_day', '欄位型別是 numeric(4,1)：public.monthly_store_summary.business_days', '門市月統計的營業天數欄位可放 0.5 天（numeric(4,1)，原本是整數）。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT format_type(a.atttypid, a.atttypmod) = 'numeric(4,1)' FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.monthly_store_summary') AND a.attname = 'business_days' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped), false)),
  ('20261004110000_monthly_store_summary_business_days_half_day', '欄位註解含「支援 0.5 天」：public.monthly_store_summary.business_days', '營業天數欄位註解是這支 migration 寫的。只缺這項、上一項成立，代表欄位型別是用別的方式改的，沒有影響使用。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('支援 0.5 天' IN col_description(a.attrelid, a.attnum)) > 0 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.monthly_store_summary') AND a.attname = 'business_days' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped), false)),
  ('20261007120000_add_acting_manager_movement_type', '約束定義含「acting_manager」：valid_movement_type on public.employee_movement_history', '異動類型約束允許「代理店長（acting_manager）」。正式區若沒套用，異動登記代理店長會被資料庫擋下。', '步驟 34（m9-sql/80_movement_batch_monthly_roster.sql）：會重建 valid_movement_type（一樣含 acting_manager），這項缺了無妨', COALESCE((SELECT position('acting_manager' IN pg_get_constraintdef(c.oid)) > 0 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conrelid = to_regclass('public.employee_movement_history') AND c.conname = 'valid_movement_type'), false)),
  ('20261007120000_add_acting_manager_movement_type', '欄位註解含「acting_manager(代理)」：public.employee_movement_history.movement_type', '異動類型欄位註解是這支 migration 寫的（補強上一項）。只缺這項、上一項成立，代表約束是用別的方式改的，沒有影響使用。', NULL, COALESCE((SELECT position('acting_manager(代理)' IN col_description(a.attrelid, a.attnum)) > 0 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.employee_movement_history') AND a.attname = 'movement_type' AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped), false)),
  ('20261019120000_allow_zero_bonus_import', '觸發器已不存在：trg_preserve_monthly_bonus_nonzero_values on public.monthly_bonus_records', '舊的「非零獎金不可被 0 覆蓋」觸發器已不存在（成立也可能是從來沒建過，結果都正確）。步驟 1（05）也查同一件事。', NULL, (to_regclass('public.monthly_bonus_records') IS NOT NULL AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_trigger g WHERE g.tgrelid = to_regclass('public.monthly_bonus_records') AND g.tgname = 'trg_preserve_monthly_bonus_nonzero_values' AND NOT g.tgisinternal))),
  ('20261019120000_allow_zero_bonus_import', '函式已不存在：public.preserve_monthly_bonus_nonzero_values()', '該觸發器的函式也已刪除。', NULL, to_regprocedure('public.preserve_monthly_bonus_nonzero_values()') IS NULL)
)
SELECT jsonb_build_object(
         'generated_at', to_char(now() AT TIME ZONE 'Asia/Taipei', 'YYYY-MM-DD"T"HH24:MI:SS') || '+08:00',
         'total_checked', (SELECT count(*) FROM items),
         'present_count', (SELECT count(*) FROM items WHERE ok),
         'missing', coalesce((SELECT jsonb_agg(jsonb_build_object('migration', migration, 'marker', marker, 'meaning', meaning, 'superseded_by', superseded_by) ORDER BY migration, marker) FROM items WHERE NOT ok), '[]'::jsonb),
         'undeterminable', '[{"migration":"20261005120000_repair_newbie_promotion_timeline","reason":"純資料修補：一次性 UPDATE，替升遷成「新人」的異動備註補上「新人等級:」，並依升遷歷史重算每月人員狀態的職位與新人階級。改完之後資料庫不留下任何痕跡（沒有新欄位、約束或註解），無法用唯讀查詢判斷它有沒有跑過。風險：沒補的話，步驟 34（80_movement_batch_monthly_roster）的名冊重算會讀異動備註的「新人等級」，重算出的新人階級可能是空的或錯的。後續取代情形：步驟 34 的重算會覆蓋「草稿月份」的每月人員狀態職位與階級，但不會補異動備註，已送審／已確認月份也不動，所以這支不算被完整取代。替代做法：結果裡 observations 的兩個筆數就是這支 migration 現在還會改幾筆；0 代表已無待修（已套用或本來就不需要），大於 0 代表資料還沒修。"}]'::jsonb,
         'observations', jsonb_build_array(
           jsonb_build_object('migration', '20261005120000_repair_newbie_promotion_timeline', 'label', '待補「新人等級」備註的升遷異動筆數（0 = 已補或本來就不需要）', 'pending_rows', CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.employee_movement_history') AND a.attname = 'notes' AND NOT a.attisdropped) AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.monthly_staff_status') AND a.attname = 'newbie_level' AND NOT a.attisdropped) THEN ((xpath('/row/c/text()', query_to_xml('SELECT count(*) AS c
FROM public.employee_movement_history AS movement
JOIN LATERAL (
  SELECT monthly.newbie_level
  FROM public.monthly_staff_status AS monthly
  WHERE monthly.employee_code = movement.employee_code
    AND monthly.position = ''新人''
    AND monthly.newbie_level IN (''未過階新人'', ''一階新人'', ''二階新人'')
    AND monthly.year_month >= to_char(movement.movement_date, ''YYYY-MM'')
    AND monthly.year_month < COALESCE((
      SELECT min(to_char(next_movement.movement_date, ''YYYY-MM''))
      FROM public.employee_movement_history AS next_movement
      WHERE next_movement.employee_code = movement.employee_code
        AND next_movement.movement_type = ''promotion''
        AND next_movement.movement_date > movement.movement_date
        AND next_movement.new_value <> ''代理店長''
    ), ''9999-12'')
  ORDER BY CASE WHEN monthly.store_id = movement.store_id THEN 0 ELSE 1 END, monthly.year_month, monthly.updated_at DESC
  LIMIT 1
) AS snapshot ON true
WHERE movement.movement_type = ''promotion''
  AND movement.new_value = ''新人''
  AND COALESCE(movement.notes, '''') !~ ''新人等級[:：]''', false, true, '')))[1]::text::bigint) END),
           jsonb_build_object('migration', '20261005120000_repair_newbie_promotion_timeline', 'label', '每月人員狀態中，職位或新人階級與升遷歷史不一致的列數（0 = 已重算或本來就一致）', 'pending_rows', CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.employee_movement_history') AND a.attname = 'notes' AND NOT a.attisdropped) AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM pg_attribute a WHERE a.attrelid = to_regclass('public.monthly_staff_status') AND a.attname = 'newbie_level' AND NOT a.attisdropped) THEN ((xpath('/row/c/text()', query_to_xml('WITH monthly_targets AS (
  SELECT monthly.id, monthly.employee_code, monthly.year_month,
    (to_date(monthly.year_month || ''-01'', ''YYYY-MM-DD'') + interval ''1 month'')::date AS month_end
  FROM public.monthly_staff_status AS monthly
  WHERE EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM public.employee_movement_history AS movement
    WHERE movement.employee_code = monthly.employee_code
      AND movement.movement_type = ''promotion''
      AND movement.movement_date < (to_date(monthly.year_month || ''-01'', ''YYYY-MM-DD'') + interval ''1 month'')::date
  )
), resolved_positions AS (
  SELECT target.id,
    COALESCE(regular_position.new_value, latest_movement.old_value, m0.position) AS resolved_position,
    (regexp_match(regular_position.notes, ''(新人等級|行政階級)[:：]([^；\n]+)''))[2] AS history_level
  FROM monthly_targets AS target
  JOIN public.monthly_staff_status AS m0 ON m0.id = target.id
  LEFT JOIN LATERAL (
    SELECT movement.new_value, movement.notes FROM public.employee_movement_history AS movement
    WHERE movement.employee_code = target.employee_code AND movement.movement_type = ''promotion''
      AND movement.new_value <> ''代理店長'' AND movement.movement_date < target.month_end
    ORDER BY movement.movement_date DESC, movement.created_at DESC, movement.id DESC LIMIT 1
  ) AS regular_position ON true
  LEFT JOIN LATERAL (
    SELECT movement.new_value, movement.old_value FROM public.employee_movement_history AS movement
    WHERE movement.employee_code = target.employee_code AND movement.movement_type = ''promotion''
      AND movement.movement_date < target.month_end
    ORDER BY movement.movement_date DESC, movement.created_at DESC, movement.id DESC LIMIT 1
  ) AS latest_movement ON true
)
SELECT count(*) AS c
FROM public.monthly_staff_status AS monthly
JOIN resolved_positions AS resolved ON resolved.id = monthly.id
WHERE monthly.position IS DISTINCT FROM resolved.resolved_position
  OR monthly.newbie_level IS DISTINCT FROM CASE
    WHEN resolved.resolved_position IN (''新人'', ''行政'') THEN COALESCE(
      resolved.history_level,
      CASE WHEN monthly.position = resolved.resolved_position THEN monthly.newbie_level ELSE NULL END)
    ELSE NULL
  END', false, true, '')))[1]::text::bigint) END)
         )
       ) AS result;
